+
+## JSON Merge Patch
+
+`applyMergePatch(target, patch)` applies an
+[RFC 7386 JSON Merge Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7386) without
+changing either input. Object-valued patches update their members recursively;
+a member set to `null` removes that member. Any non-object patch value,
+including an array, replaces the target value.
+
+```ts
+import { applyMergePatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+const updated = applyMergePatch(
+  { profile: { name: "Ari", nickname: "A" }, tags: ["new", "beta"] },
+  { profile: { nickname: null }, tags: ["stable"] },
+);
+
+// { profile: { name: "Ari" }, tags: ["stable"] }
+```
